      "html": "<button class=\"ds-pill\">Create PDF</button> <button class=\"ds-pill\" disabled>Create PDF</button>",
      "css": ".ds-pill{height:50px;padding:0 28px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:#f5f5f7;color:#000;font:600 17px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'SF Pro Text',Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-0.015em;cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s,color .2s,transform .15s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}.ds-pill:hover:not(:disabled){background:#fff}.ds-pill:active:not(:disabled){transform:scale(.97)}.ds-pill:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #7c95ff;outline-offset:3px}.ds-pill:disabled{background:#1d1d1f;color:#86868b;cursor:default}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Secondary Pill",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-secondary",
      "description": "Choose Images: translucent fill pill on black.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-pill2\">Choose Images</button>",
      "css": ".ds-pill2{height:44px;padding:0 22px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:rgb(255 255 255 / .11);color:#f5f5f7;font:500 17px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'SF Pro Text',Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-0.015em;cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s,transform .15s}.ds-pill2:hover{background:rgb(255 255 255 / .16)}.ds-pill2:active{transform:scale(.97)}.ds-pill2:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #7c95ff;outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Filename Field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "field",
      "description": "Solid dark field with inline label and fixed .pdf suffix.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\"><span class=\"ds-field-l\">File name</span><input value=\"output\"><span class=\"ds-field-x\">.pdf</span></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;width:420px;min-height:50px;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:14px;background:#161618;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'SF Pro Text',Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:text;transition:background .2s,box-shadow .2s}.ds-field:hover{background:#1f1f22}.ds-field:focus-within{background:#1f1f22;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #7c95ff}.ds-field-l{color:#86868b;font-size:15px}.ds-field input{flex:1;min-width:0;padding:0;border:0;outline:none;background:none;color:#f5f5f7;caret-color:#7c95ff;font:inherit;font-size:17px}.ds-field-x{color:#86868b;font-size:17px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Local Nav",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "theme-toggle",
      "description": "52px translucent bar: wordmark, caption links, theme toggle pill.",
      "html": "<header class=\"ds-nav\"><a class=\"ds-wm\" href=\"#\">pdfyier</a><div class=\"ds-right\"><nav class=\"ds-links\"><a href=\"#\">Privacy</a><a href=\"#\">How it works</a><a href=\"#\">Help</a></nav><button class=\"ds-toggle\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 13l.9-3.4L11.4 2.1a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 2 0l.5.5a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 0 2L6.4 12.1 3 13z\"/><path d=\"M10.2 3.3l2.5 2.5\"/></svg>Paper</button></div></header>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{height:52px;padding:0 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;background:rgb(0 0 0 / .72);backdrop-filter:saturate(180%) blur(20px);box-shadow:inset 0 -1px 0 rgb(255 255 255 / .08);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'SF Pro Text',Inter,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-wm{color:#f5f5f7;text-decoration:none;font-size:21px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.02em}.ds-right{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px}.ds-links{display:flex;gap:24px}.ds-links a{color:#a1a1a6;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;transition:color .2s}.ds-links a:hover{color:#f5f5f7}.ds-toggle{height:30px;padding:0 12px 0 10px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:rgb(255 255 255 / .07);color:#f5f5f7;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-family:inherit;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s}.ds-toggle:hover{background:rgb(255 255 255 / .11)}.ds-toggle:focus-visible,.ds-links a:focus-visible,.ds-wm:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #7c95ff;outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Page on a Pool of Light",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "page-badge",
      "description": "A page at true aspect with number badge, cobalt rim light and its floor pool; lifts on hover as when grabbed.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-stage\"><div class=\"ds-page\"><div class=\"ds-sheet\"><span class=\"ds-badge\">1</span></div><span class=\"ds-pool\"></span></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-stage{padding:28px 40px 8px;background:#000;display:flex;justify-content:center}.ds-page{display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding:0 12px}.ds-sheet{position:relative;height:176px;width:132px;border-radius:3px;background:#f4f2ec;box-shadow:0 26px 34px -18px rgb(0 0 0 / .95),0 10px 14px -8px rgb(0 0 0 / .8),inset 0 -1.5px 0 rgb(36 72 255 / .8);transition:transform .35s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-page:hover .ds-sheet{transform:translateY(-10px) scale(1.04)}.ds-badge{position:absolute;left:6px;bottom:7px;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 7px;border-radius:11px;background:rgb(0 0 0 / .62);color:#fff;font:600 12px/22px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'SF Pro Text',Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;text-align:center}.ds-pool{position:relative;align-self:stretch;height:26px;margin:0 -8px;background:radial-gradient(34% 55% at 50% 0%,rgb(0 0 0 / .75),transparent 100%),radial-gradient(50% 100% at 50% 0%,rgb(36 72 255 / .6),transparent 100%)}.ds-pool::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:5%;right:5%;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,rgb(36 72 255),transparent)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Horizon Line",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "horizon",
      "description": "The one full-bleed line with a near-white core and cobalt glow above; rides the dock's top edge.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-hz\"><span class=\"ds-hz-glow\"></span><span class=\"ds-hz-line\"></span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-hz{position:relative;height:220px;background:#000;overflow:hidden}.ds-hz-glow{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:40px;height:180px;background:radial-gradient(70% 100% at 50% 100%,rgb(36 72 255 / .5) 0%,rgb(36 72 255 / .17) 36%,transparent 72%)}.ds-hz-line{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:40px;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent 0%,rgb(36 72 255 / .75) 16%,rgb(214 222 255) 50%,rgb(36 72 255 / .75) 84%,transparent 100%)}.ds-hz-line::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:-3px 12%;background:inherit;filter:blur(5px)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Paper Primary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "paper-button-primary",
      "description": "Blue-ink hand-looped Create PDF button; the label stays in print.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-ppill\">Create PDF</button>",
      "css": ".ds-ppill{height:50px;padding:0 28px;border:0;border-radius:255px 20px 225px 20px / 20px 225px 20px 255px;background:#1d3a9a;color:#fff;font:600 17px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'SF Pro Text',Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-0.015em;cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s,transform .15s}.ds-ppill:hover{background:#2447b8}.ds-ppill:active{transform:scale(.97)}.ds-ppill:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #1d3a9a;outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Paper Secondary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "paper-button-secondary",
      "description": "Pen-drawn outline loop with a highlighter wash on hover.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-ppill2\">Choose Images</button>",
      "css": ".ds-ppill2{height:44px;padding:0 22px;border:0;border-radius:255px 18px 225px 18px / 18px 225px 18px 255px;background:transparent;color:#1d3a9a;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px #1d3a9a;font:500 17px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'SF Pro Text',Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-0.015em;cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s,transform .15s}.ds-ppill2:hover{background:rgb(255 226 64 / .35)}.ds-ppill2:active{transform:scale(.97)}.ds-ppill2:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #1d3a9a;outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Paper Filename Line",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "paper-field",
      "description": "A name written on a line: underline only, handwritten label, highlighter on focus.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-pfield\"><span class=\"ds-pfield-l\">File name</span><input value=\"output\"><span class=\"ds-pfield-x\">.pdf</span></label>",
      "css": ".ds-pfield{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;width:420px;min-height:50px;padding:12px 16px;background:transparent;box-shadow:inset 0 -2px 0 rgb(29 58 154 / .45);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'SF Pro Text',Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:text;transition:background .2s,box-shadow .2s}.ds-pfield:hover{box-shadow:inset 0 -2px 0 rgb(29 58 154 / .7)}.ds-pfield:focus-within{background:rgb(255 226 64 / .2);box-shadow:inset 0 -2px 0 #1d3a9a}.ds-pfield-l{color:#5f6576;font-family:Kalam,'Bradley Hand','Segoe Print',cursive;font-size:18px}.ds-pfield input{flex:1;min-width:0;padding:0;border:0;outline:none;background:none;color:#1f2433;caret-color:#1d3a9a;font:inherit;font-size:17px}.ds-pfield-x{color:#5f6576;font-size:17px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Taped Photo Page",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "paper-page-badge",
      "description": "Page taped into the ruled notebook at a slight tilt, number circled in red pen.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-nb\"><div class=\"ds-tp\"><span class=\"ds-tape\"></span><span class=\"ds-circ\">1</span></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-nb{padding:30px 40px;background-color:#fbfbf8;background-image:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 31px,#d3e2f1 31px,#d3e2f1 32px,transparent 32px);background-size:100% 32px}.ds-tp{position:relative;height:176px;width:132px;border-radius:1px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 1px 1px rgb(31 36 51 / .1),0 10px 18px -10px rgb(31 36 51 / .4);rotate:-0.9deg;transition:rotate .35s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1),transform .35s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-tp:hover{transform:scale(1.06);rotate:-2.5deg}.ds-tape{position:absolute;top:-9px;left:50%;width:58px;height:20px;translate:-50% 0;rotate:-0.2deg;background:rgb(236 226 196 / .78);box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgb(31 36 51 / .14)}.ds-circ{position:absolute;left:6px;bottom:7px;min-width:26px;height:26px;padding:0 6px;background:#fff;color:#c62f2e;border:1.5px solid currentColor;border-radius:55% 45% 52% 48% / 48% 55% 45% 52%;font:700 15px/22px Kalam,'Bradley Hand','Segoe Print',cursive;text-align:center}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Lit Stage and the Notebook",
    "overview": "pdfyier is one converter shown in two materials that share a single skeleton. In the dark, the page is a cyclorama before dawn: a depthless black sky, one full-bleed horizon line with a near-white core riding the top edge of the dock, and pages standing at their true aspect on pools of floor light. The light is the progress indicator. Four registered number properties (cobalt, rose, day, surge) are set by the job's phase: night when empty, cobalt first light once pages are set, rose dawn climbing with the upload percentage, warm white day when the PDF lands. The mood is Apple's dark Pro pages: SF Pro on Apple devices, self-hosted Inter elsewhere, a white pill primary, solid dark fields.\n\nIn the light, the same stage becomes a ruled college notebook (user-pinned): blue rules every 32px under a blank header band, a red margin line, blue-ballpoint ink, Kalam handwriting for headings and notes only. Pages become photos taped in at a slight random tilt, page numbers are circled in red pen, and the lamps map to paper tools: a yellow highlighter grows along the line the pages sit on with upload %, each page gets a red-pen check as its bytes leave, and a red check marks the finished status. Theme follows `prefers-color-scheme`, is remembered, and switches through a circular view transition opening from the toggle.\n\nDensity is low and centered. Nothing is boxed: light (dark) or ruled lines and tape (paper) separate things, together with generous spacing.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "One system, two theme-scoped token sets on `data-theme` (`dark` / `paper`); components change material, never structure.",
      "State is carried by light (dark) or pen and highlighter (paper), always doubled by status text and button labels.",
      "Pages keep their true aspect ratio; the stage never crops them into a uniform grid.",
      "A single horizon line on the dock's top edge, which floats with the dock when pages overflow.",
      "Print type for everything you operate; handwriting only for what a student would write in."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Light Is the Progress Rule",
        "body": "Lamp colours appear only as light: gradients, pools, rim edges and the horizon line, driven by `--lx-*` levels. Never use cobalt, rose or day as a flat button, card or text fill.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Earned Dawn Rule",
        "body": "Rose appears only while bytes are leaving and Day only when a PDF has landed. No decorative sunrise at rest.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Three Tools Rule",
        "body": "Paper colour is limited to what a student carries: blue ballpoint, red pen, yellow highlighter, plus the notebook's rules, margin and tape.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Print for Controls Rule",
        "body": "Buttons, the filename input, body copy, status text and nav links are always SF Pro / Inter, in both themes. Kalam is reserved for headings, notes, labels and marks (wordmark, headings, detail line, field label, add tile, page numbers, step numbers).",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Tracking Follows Size Rule",
        "body": "Print tracking runs from -0.022em at display down to 0 at 12px. Handwriting is always 0.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The No Box Rule",
        "body": "No content cards and no bordered panels. Separation comes from light, spacing and single hairlines (`inset 0 1px 0` rules between FAQ items and footer rows). Filled, rounded surfaces are reserved for controls, code and the pages themselves.",
        "section": "elevation"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Light Follows the Job Rule",
        "body": "Every lamp level is set by phase or progress (`night`, `first`, `dawn`, `day`, `error`, plus `surge` while files hover). Nothing glows independently of state.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** drive every lamp from state: set `data-phase` and the `--lx-*` numbers, and let the registered properties fade (cobalt 1.4s, rose 0.6s, day 2.2s).",
      "**Do** keep pages at their true aspect ratio: height from `--page-h`, width from the image's own ratio.",
      "**Do** keep a text equivalent for every light phase in the status line and button labels.",
      "**Do** use `cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)` for arrivals, lifts and lamps, and `cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1)` for settles, reflows and progress. Under reduced motion, stop the sheen and pulse, show the tick fully drawn, and snap drags.",
      "**Do** scope every paper change under `:root[data-theme=\"paper\"]` and change material only: ink, tape, rules, highlighter. Keep the layout identical across themes.",
      "**Do** tilt each paper photo by its own random angle (±1.3deg) and circle its number in red pen.",
      "**Do** self-host every font (Inter, Kalam); no visit touches a third party."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** put content in cards or bordered panels; light, spacing and single hairlines separate things.",
      "**Don't** fill buttons, text or surfaces with cobalt, rose or day in the dark theme; they are light only.",
      "**Don't** set buttons, the filename value, body copy or status text in Kalam.",
      "**Don't** crop pages into uniform thumbnails or square tiles.",
      "**Don't** add paper colours beyond blue ballpoint, red pen, yellow highlighter and the notebook's rule, margin and tape.",
      "**Don't** show rose or day light while nothing is uploading or nothing has landed."
    ]
  }
}
